 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "ApparelAdvisor ⊣ Apparel Governor, langgraph-clj StateGraph,
 append-only audit ledger. A plant OPERATIONS COORDINATION actor for
 apparel manufacturing (ISIC 1410) -- not direct sewing/cutting-line
 control authority and not a pattern craft engine. Four ops
 (`:order-intake` / `:pattern-spec` / `:quality-flag` /
 `:shipment-coordinate`), all `:effect :propose` only. Concrete
 governor checks: propose-only effect, closed op allowlist, closed
 proposal-effect allowlist (no sewing-machine control), permanent
 direct-operate block, permanent safety-cert-finalization block,
 independent order verification/registration before shipment
 coordination, independent shipment-quantity recompute against the
 order's own logged quantity, and size-code validation on pattern-spec
 metadata. Quality-flag ALWAYS escalates to a human plant supervisor;
 `:order-intake` is the only op eligible to auto-commit, and only at
 phase 3 when governor-clean. Pattern craft engine deliberately out of
 this wave."}
